AI-Bot pendrive package — placeholder for llama-server binaries.
================================================================

Place the portable llama.cpp server binary here.

Required (CPU build, Windows):
  bin/llama-server.exe

Optional (Vulkan GPU build, Windows):
  bin/llama-server-vulkan.exe

Linux/macOS:
  bin/llama-server

Download llama.cpp releases (look for the "llama-server" binary):
  https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp/releases

Choose a recent release (e.g. b4248 or later) and grab the CPU-only
binary for your platform. The binary is ~40-70 MB.

No installation is required — just copy the .exe into this bin folder.